All attempts to generate images using the \texttt{image\_generation\_tool} have failed, mostly due to a `\texttt{429 Too Many Requests'' error, some }\texttt{500 Internal Server Error'', and one }\texttt{Read timed out''. This indicates an issue with the image generation service's availability or rate limits. Therefore, I am unable to replace the }[IMAGE\_NEEDED...]` tags with actual image links as requested. I cannot provide the final Markdown presentation with resolved image placeholders.
